			"props": {
				"color": "black",
				"size": "m",
				"w": 919.997802734375,
				"text": "Think of it like this: Regular WordPress is like having one worker doing everything, while WordPress + PHP-FPM is like having specialized workers for different tasks, making the whole process more efficient.",
